@editeconomy

- @increasegrowth: Increase Economic Growth by 5%
- @decreasegrowth: Decrease Economic Growth by 5%
- @increaseinflation: Increase Inflation by 5%
- @decreaseinflation: Decrease Inflation by 5%
- @increaseunemployment: Increase Unemployment by 5%
- @decreaseunemployment: Decrease Unemployment by 5%
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@increasegrowth
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.economic_growth += 5;
!}

Increased economic growth by 5%.

@decreasegrowth
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.economic_growth -= 5;
!}

Decreased economic growth by 5%.

@increaseinflation
